---
title: Jack's Chicken Dipping Sauce
image: https://easykitchenguide.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Homemade-honey-mustard-sauce-recipe-2-768x1365.jpg
---

Whisk @mayonnaise{1/2%cup}, @yellow mustard{1%tbsp}, @dijon mustard{1%tbsp}, @barbecue sauce{2%tbsp}, and @honey{2.5%tbsp}(reduce to 2 tbsp if using honey barbecue sauce) together until combined.

Lasts about a week in a sealed container.